 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 1.051,
   "end": 2.872,
   "text": "She's like, I'm going to go where the Wi-Fi is."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.692,
   "end": 5.633,
   "text": "Am I still coming off?"
  },
  {
   "start": 5.653,
   "end": 6.073,
   "text": "Is it better?"
  },
  {
   "start": 6.793,
   "end": 7.253,
   "text": "You're better."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.754,
   "end": 9.454,
   "text": "It's in and out."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.634,
   "end": 11.395,
   "text": "You're freezing coming in and out."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.615,
   "end": 14.335,
   "text": "Should I go in the phone?"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.636,
   "end": 16.596,
   "text": "Should I go in the phone?"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.276,
   "end": 17.957,
   "text": "I don't think so."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.517,
   "end": 23.678,
   "text": "I think you should just tell us what you're feeling right now and how you're still going regardless of how you feel."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.698,
   "end": 25.179,
   "text": "Oh, yeah, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.199,
   "end": 27.039,
   "text": "No, I'm solution mode."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.079,
   "end": 27.96,
   "text": "Solution mode."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.338,
   "end": 57.229,
   "text": "right we're getting to see it in real time she's like solution mode i'm gonna jump out and jump back in let me ask you a question while she does this man like how many people have found themselves in board meetings maybe at work i'm talking about outside of any social media and something like this i think it's even more stressful there like when you're at work and your equipment doesn't work right your internet's jacking up and there's some technical difficulty that you've never encountered before that just wants to pop up on that day"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.942,
   "end": 61.463,
   "text": "It's like your stress level goes through the roof."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.483,
   "end": 63.304,
   "text": "I remember that happened one time I was teaching a class."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.884,
   "end": 66.425,
   "text": "So what I ended up having to do was just teach from the book."
  },
  {
   "start": 66.545,
   "end": 73.067,
   "text": "I had a book with pictures in it, but instead of having what I had in the book on a screen, I just taught from the book."
  },
  {
   "start": 73.868,
   "end": 74.428,
   "text": "And it went well."
  },
  {
   "start": 75.408,
   "end": 76.148,
   "text": "You got to adjust, man."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.168,
   "end": 77.069,
   "text": "You got to be able to adapt."
  },
  {
   "start": 82.521,
   "end": 83.282,
   "text": "You're good now."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.522,
   "end": 86.204,
   "text": "We were just talking about, like, this is a perfect example."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.244,
   "end": 87.304,
   "text": "This is streaming on LinkedIn."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.324,
   "end": 90.966,
   "text": "There's people on LinkedIn that are probably going to see this or that are watching right now."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.887,
   "end": 99.411,
   "text": "And it's mortifying when your internet goes out or something freezes or things aren't going as planned."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.451,
   "end": 105.835,
   "text": "But the beauty of it is to be able to improv and make it a part of whatever you're doing, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 105.855,
   "end": 107.236,
   "text": "There you go."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.097,
   "end": 109.157,
   "text": "or make fun of it."
  },
  {
   "start": 109.378,
   "end": 112.899,
   "text": "Self-deprecation, fastest way to get the crowd happy."
  },
  {
   "start": 112.919,
   "end": 113.499,
   "text": "Behind you, yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 113.579,
   "end": 113.899,
   "text": "Right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 113.959,
   "end": 114.279,
   "text": "Yeah."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.78,
   "end": 116.92,
   "text": "They're like, oh yeah, we can make fun of you."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.301,
   "end": 118.661,
   "text": "As long as you don't make fun of us."
  },
  {
   "start": 118.681,
   "end": 121.322,
   "text": "And that's okay too."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.422,
   "end": 125.204,
   "text": "It's like when you take a fall, man."
  },
  {
   "start": 125.484,
   "end": 126.704,
   "text": "I know whatever I'm taking a fall."
  },
  {
   "start": 126.724,
   "end": 134.087,
   "text": "As you're trying to go in from the phone, okay, I used to, because what's happening is that you guys are cutting off for me."
  },
  {
   "start": 134.107,
   "end": 136.548,
   "text": "And I'm cutting off for you."
  },
  {
   "start": 137.177,
   "end": 139.831,
   "text": "for you guys or for the rest of the people."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.601,
   "end": 142.184,
   "text": "See what I did."
  }
 ],
